# GEMINI_API_KEY — optional. Powers Auto-Parent AI clip matching.
#
# Read at BUILD time by the Secrets Gradle Plugin (see app/build.gradle.kts) and
# injected as BuildConfig.GEMINI_API_KEY. To use a real key, copy this file to
# `.env` in this directory (that file is gitignored) and put your key there.
#
# Left as the placeholder below, the app makes NO network calls at all and
# Auto-Parent falls back to on-device keyword matching. Only text ever leaves the
# device — never audio. See ../docs/ANDROID_APP_SPEC.md §2.
#
# Before publishing, restrict the key in Google Cloud Console (Android package +
# SHA-256, daily quota caps) — keys shipped in an APK can be extracted.
GEMINI_API_KEY=MY_GEMINI_API_KEY
